      "id": "hann-psd",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "description": "For each complete 512-sample window, remove arithmetic mean before applying periodic Hann w[n]=0.5−0.5cos(2πn/N). PSD=|DFT(w*(x−mean))|²/(fs*sum(w²)), doubling bins1..N/2−1 only. Retain float32 Pa²/Hz. No zero padding. Window starts advance 128 samples; no partial final window."
